01:11:54.340 --> 01:11:55.340
What are you going to call?

01:11:55.800 --> 01:11:57.750
What are you going to call?

01:11:58.390 --> 01:11:59.970
Do not interrupt me!

01:12:00.670 --> 01:12:03.990
Excuse me, old man, but I've been here for three days, and I've realized that you, Gorduchi,

01:12:04.190 --> 01:12:05.020
are a mess.

01:12:05.700 --> 01:12:06.040
What?

01:12:06.440 --> 01:12:09.100
Yes, old man, you can cheat on the other, but as far as I'm concerned,

01:12:09.100 --> 01:12:11.490
you think I don't live off the poker players.

01:12:11.570 --> 01:12:12.790
They're trustworthy people.

01:12:13.030 --> 01:12:14.270
For you? And that Lulu?

01:12:14.610 --> 01:12:16.890
And that merchandise that goes out without destination or control?

01:12:17.200 --> 01:12:19.100
Why do you want 50,000 fax a month?

01:12:19.260 --> 01:12:21.840
But where do you hide all those fat women, those guaypes?

01:12:22.220 --> 01:12:25.320
Go away, go away!

01:12:25.560 --> 01:12:27.140
I forgive you, I don't know why.

01:12:27.570 --> 01:12:29.170
All right, I'm leaving, you think about it.

01:12:29.350 --> 01:12:29.980
I don't know why I'm leaving, I don't know why I'm leaving, I don't know why I'm leaving.

01:12:30.000 --> 01:12:31.440
Don't get involved if you want to jump with me.

01:12:31.680 --> 01:12:32.540
Answer me later.

01:12:32.860 --> 01:12:35.860
I'm in a café in San Telmo. Ask Luisito in the café at dawn.

01:12:40.180 --> 01:12:43.180
With my resemblance and his ability to put his hand in the can...

01:12:43.180 --> 01:12:44.640
...I'll be able to get the hell out of here.

01:12:45.000 --> 01:12:49.380
Break that letter. Don't miss it. What are you waiting for?

01:12:49.480 --> 01:12:52.040
Close that door.

01:12:52.220 --> 01:12:53.740
Come on!

01:13:01.440 --> 01:13:09.290
Sit down. How do you want to go in this business?

01:13:10.140 --> 01:13:10.800
Study it yourself.

01:13:11.150 --> 01:13:13.830
When you have a fablister, let me know. I'll grab the money and get to work.

01:13:14.200 --> 01:13:15.980
And meanwhile, I'll keep sending the parts to this desk.

01:13:16.790 --> 01:13:17.150
Done.

01:13:17.550 --> 01:13:20.960
How could you fail me with that face of Marandren?

01:13:21.100 --> 01:13:23.980
So much. A modest industrial, nothing more.

01:13:24.320 --> 01:13:27.080
See you later, Don Miguel Angel.

01:13:27.480 --> 01:13:29.760
Bye, Scardula.

01:13:32.170 --> 01:13:33.550
Good morning, Mr. Gaspar.

01:13:33.710 --> 01:13:36.550
Good morning.

01:13:36.770 --> 01:13:45.740
What did the fiera say? Did she make a fuss about the drunkard last night?

01:13:45.880 --> 01:13:47.380
I have great news. She blew the bomb.

01:13:47.620 --> 01:13:47.920
One year.

01:13:48.240 --> 01:13:49.680
She received a letter from her son, Miguel Ángel.

01:13:49.720 --> 01:13:51.240
Where is the child?

01:13:51.400 --> 01:13:53.460
In Córdoba, in the summer, but she says she'll be back soon.

01:13:53.680 --> 01:13:55.620
What are you doing?

01:13:55.700 --> 01:13:58.500
But now, with fame, give me two tickets to the Antarctic.

01:13:58.680 --> 01:13:59.960
Hang it, the letter...

01:14:00.640 --> 01:14:04.350
But why did you do that? But you want to kill me.

01:14:06.180 --> 01:14:17.500
So you, Miguel Angel, Luisito...

01:14:17.500 --> 01:14:21.070
The same person, Polo. I just lived a double life that I needed.

01:14:21.680 --> 01:14:25.540
Because the oppression that Miguel Angel endured between these four walls...

01:14:25.540 --> 01:14:28.110
Luisito overcame it with his soul of a bohemian.

01:14:28.230 --> 01:14:29.860
It's been two years since I've been a...

01:14:30.600 --> 01:14:33.280
How many things do you learn by living with the people you need?

01:14:33.700 --> 01:14:36.470
What exploits are we, Polo?

01:14:36.510 --> 01:14:38.900
Do you know how they call Miguel Angel Gorduchy in the factory?

01:14:39.970 --> 01:14:42.460
Bloodsucker, blacksmith, pirate and moron.

01:14:42.540 --> 01:14:43.470
And that's me.

01:14:43.730 --> 01:14:44.990
However, the people...

01:14:44.990 --> 01:14:45.710
That's why I came back.

01:14:45.770 --> 01:14:47.930
If you knew what they told me about Don Gaspar.

01:14:48.110 --> 01:14:50.710
But who were you with? With the happy comadres of Winsor?

01:14:50.790 --> 01:14:52.250
What comadres? I've confirmed it myself.

01:14:52.650 --> 01:14:54.420
Don Gaspar is a vulgar scammer.

01:14:54.560 --> 01:14:54.900
No!

01:14:55.310 --> 01:14:56.850
I just simulated a pact with him.

01:14:56.910 --> 01:14:59.970
And now he went to prepare a plan to overthrow Miguel Angel Gorduchy and all his...

01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:02.200
Will it be possible, Mr. Gaspar?

01:15:02.380 --> 01:15:03.120
Yes, Mr. Gaspar.

01:15:03.260 --> 01:15:03.800
What a success!

01:15:04.260 --> 01:15:08.110
Not so much, because with this I lost Margarita.

01:15:08.170 --> 01:15:12.000
The father found out about everything, I knew it last night for herself.

01:15:12.460 --> 01:15:13.900
And how could they know that?

01:15:14.760 --> 01:15:16.700
Margarita's father and the blonde work in our factory.

01:15:16.880 --> 01:15:18.000
But this is a movie, sir.

01:15:18.260 --> 01:15:20.240
And they told me that there is a rebellion environment.

01:15:20.460 --> 01:15:23.400
Sir, excuse me, a delegation of workers wants to see you.

01:15:23.440 --> 01:15:24.480
They say it's urgent.

01:15:24.840 --> 01:15:28.170
Look, there they are. Tell them what's going on.

01:15:28.370 --> 01:15:28.810
All right, sir.

01:15:33.960 --> 01:15:36.730
Go ahead, go ahead.

01:15:37.910 --> 01:15:40.230
We're here for you to study this arrangement of conditions, sir.

01:15:40.630 --> 01:15:42.020
Don Severo, I owe you an explanation.

01:15:42.620 --> 01:15:45.340
I can't listen to you in another field other than the gremial.

01:15:45.680 --> 01:15:48.800
If at any given moment you wanted to make fun of us, go ahead.

01:15:49.650 --> 01:15:50.370
Listen, Rubio.

01:15:50.470 --> 01:15:51.370
You're no longer my friend.

01:15:51.690 --> 01:15:53.150
They told me and I couldn't believe it.

01:15:53.460 --> 01:15:55.620
One day you'll realize that friendship is worth more than anything.

01:15:56.110 --> 01:15:56.850
But I can explain.

01:15:57.070 --> 01:15:57.470
Waste of time.

01:15:57.690 --> 01:15:59.970
And since I've come in representation of...

01:16:00.000 --> 01:16:02.980
to those who are not interested in our particular problem,

01:16:03.140 --> 01:16:05.890
there I leave the lead, warning him

01:16:05.890 --> 01:16:08.590
that we will not accept him to make fun of us again.

01:16:08.610 --> 01:16:10.140
But listen to me, Rubio.

01:16:10.240 --> 01:16:11.540
Please let me go.

01:16:11.600 --> 01:16:13.660
Those in your class only approach us

01:16:13.660 --> 01:16:15.160
to handle the most beautiful things.

01:16:15.220 --> 01:16:20.790
You can't succeed in everything, Polo.

01:16:21.610 --> 01:16:24.090
In any battle won, you always end up crying for something.

01:16:24.760 --> 01:16:25.800
I lost to Margarita.

01:16:25.920 --> 01:16:27.880
But do you realize why I prefer them?

01:16:27.920 --> 01:16:28.860
Because they are right.

01:16:29.300 --> 01:16:29.960
They have another purpose.

01:16:30.880 --> 01:16:34.360
What did those people want? Why didn't they talk to me?

01:16:34.540 --> 01:16:36.400
Don't worry about that. What's important is what's ours now.

01:16:37.420 --> 01:16:40.520
You can listen to him. He's the one who came to get me coffee to start this business.

01:16:40.940 --> 01:16:41.730
From whom?

01:16:42.170 --> 01:16:44.680
Another mass to distribute. In the end, we won't get anything.

01:16:45.600 --> 01:16:49.540
I never would have imagined that with that innocent face.

01:16:50.100 --> 01:16:52.400
Anyway, tomorrow is the meeting of the board.

01:16:52.880 --> 01:16:53.640
You go crazy.

01:16:54.630 --> 01:16:57.710
I'll make sure that the panic between the shareholders subsides and they want to sell.

01:16:58.170 --> 01:16:59.970
We'll buy everything for Chaucha and we'll sell it to you.

01:17:00.000 --> 01:17:01.660
And we're even left with the new mission.

01:17:01.880 --> 01:17:05.180
And if Miguel Angel shows up and bothers you, I'll shoot him.

01:17:05.980 --> 01:17:07.220
Then I'll put him back in the basement.

01:17:07.480 --> 01:17:11.180
Do whatever you want. If we do things right, we can share a million each.

01:17:11.720 --> 01:17:14.860
Well, now it's going to be less because we're more to share.

01:17:15.060 --> 01:17:16.410
Project nonsense, huh?

01:17:16.550 --> 01:17:17.850
The pirates of the Caribbean!

01:17:18.210 --> 01:17:20.350
Phenomenal! I wouldn't have thought of it better.

01:17:20.370 --> 01:17:21.530
What a magical brain!

01:17:21.750 --> 01:17:23.910
Thank you. You know it. Tomorrow, go crazy.

01:17:24.350 --> 01:17:26.150
Show your low origin well.

01:17:26.550 --> 01:17:28.830
Arrabal! A lot of arrabal!

01:17:31.560 --> 01:17:35.120
In the end, you send a tango to the director's office so we can get rid of everything sooner.

01:17:35.780 --> 01:17:39.500
Practice, but the meeting is at 5 p.m. See you later.

01:17:39.580 --> 01:17:40.360
See you later.

01:17:40.930 --> 01:17:43.940
What did the kid tell me?

01:17:44.260 --> 01:17:45.780
That was a cover-up.

01:17:47.040 --> 01:17:49.670
Let's go outside and get some air. Maybe we'll coordinate something.

01:17:50.210 --> 01:17:56.350
Why don't you call the police? What do you think, sir?

01:17:56.490 --> 01:17:59.630
I don't know. Maybe it's a favor. If there's a way to get rid of everything.

01:18:00.440 --> 01:18:03.720
Tomorrow, Miguel Angel Gorduchi, the blacksmith, will die at the board meeting.

01:18:03.720 --> 01:18:07.780
I know, sir. So that he can continue to live his soul of Bohemia.

01:18:15.140 --> 01:18:16.160
Excuse me, boss.

01:18:16.660 --> 01:18:16.820
Yes?

01:18:17.080 --> 01:18:21.120
And excuse me for talking to you in this way, but I knew it was like that.

01:18:21.340 --> 01:18:22.220
Just talk, old man.

01:18:22.360 --> 01:18:24.560
I've been working here since your father founded this.

01:18:24.920 --> 01:18:26.260
We started in a shabuá.

01:18:26.340 --> 01:18:26.600
That's right.

01:18:26.960 --> 01:18:29.060
I would need you to give me a salary.

01:18:30.000 --> 01:18:31.880
I have a sick granddaughter, my son-in-law is not well.

01:18:32.200 --> 01:18:34.160
That's all you need. Go to the cash register and ask for my name.

01:18:35.060 --> 01:18:36.420
And if you need more, let me know.

01:18:36.680 --> 01:18:37.880
Thank you very much, sir.

01:18:38.160 --> 01:18:40.080
And give me a discount in several times.

01:18:40.520 --> 01:18:41.760
Don't worry, old man.

01:18:41.820 --> 01:18:45.620
Don't worry about my pocket, because they are of that class of men who get offended if they are given money.

01:18:45.860 --> 01:18:47.370
They prefer to earn it by working.

01:18:56.650 --> 01:18:57.790
He's crazier than a goat.

01:18:58.230 --> 01:18:59.970
All these projects that I've mentioned to you...

01:19:00.000 --> 01:19:01.740
are the ones he wants to impose.

01:19:01.960 --> 01:19:03.900
He says it's just to start.

01:19:05.140 --> 01:19:06.980
And since he has the majority of the shares,

01:19:07.200 --> 01:19:08.820
he will do it and sell it to Cato.

01:19:09.080 --> 01:19:09.380
Shit!

01:19:09.800 --> 01:19:10.300
It's wrong.

01:19:10.620 --> 01:19:12.520
How are we going to raise the salaries by 50%?

01:19:12.980 --> 01:19:14.560
And what about the participation in the profits?

01:19:14.800 --> 01:19:15.420
Who cares?

01:19:16.120 --> 01:19:18.320
And the brawling with the employees without class distinction?

01:19:18.570 --> 01:19:20.090
How is the elevator guy going to tell me?

01:19:20.090 --> 01:19:21.710
Which floor do I take you, Policarpo?

01:19:21.890 --> 01:19:24.160
Do you know what he answered when I told him that?

01:19:24.280 --> 01:19:26.760
He was not to blame for you calling yourself Policarpo.

01:19:27.000 --> 01:19:29.800
But the chaos is what his last words mean.

01:19:30.320 --> 01:19:31.260
Do you know what he said to me?

01:19:31.360 --> 01:19:34.940
And forgive me for my canary-like lexicon, but I respect his own words.

01:19:35.140 --> 01:19:35.580
What did he say?

01:19:35.680 --> 01:19:36.460
He said to me,

01:19:36.460 --> 01:19:39.660
I know those Filipipones are going to protest,

01:19:40.100 --> 01:19:41.900
but let them just protest,

01:19:41.900 --> 01:19:45.720
because every slacker has the right to the wrong.

01:19:45.900 --> 01:19:47.120
The right to the wrong?

01:19:47.140 --> 01:19:47.800
What a scandal!

01:19:48.220 --> 01:19:50.000
Yes, gentlemen, it's a scandal.

01:19:50.480 --> 01:19:52.280
If Mr. Gorducci goes crazy,

01:19:52.640 --> 01:19:54.120
he won't drag us into his madness.

01:19:54.340 --> 01:19:55.330
We must sell.

01:19:55.640 --> 01:19:56.800
I say sell.

01:19:57.080 --> 01:19:58.140
Throw away the shares.

01:19:58.480 --> 01:19:59.280
Very well thought.

01:20:00.250 --> 01:20:03.890
And I, as the father of this lunatic, will also liquidate his actions

01:20:03.890 --> 01:20:07.730
so that when he recovers from his brain, he finds some weight.

01:20:08.130 --> 01:20:08.430
Very good.

01:20:11.170 --> 01:20:13.640
There comes the lunatic. Silence.

01:20:17.180 --> 01:20:17.720
Good afternoon.

01:20:18.350 --> 01:20:21.160
He died in Paris.

01:20:21.610 --> 01:20:28.450
Gentlemen, you will have noticed that in recent times I have taken attitudes that may seem strange.

01:20:29.270 --> 01:20:29.800
Calm down.

01:20:30.500 --> 01:20:34.920
A recent experience has shown me that no matter how frail we are in our business,

01:20:35.140 --> 01:20:36.720
we must not forget about life.

01:20:37.640 --> 01:20:39.840
Stay, snake, don't miss the last episode.

01:20:40.380 --> 01:20:43.840
Without contemplating the needs of those in need, it is impossible to make an effort.

01:20:44.510 --> 01:20:47.500
That is why the employees do not give up and the friends betray.

01:20:48.370 --> 01:20:50.510
Stay calm, the cowboys are coming.

01:20:50.550 --> 01:20:55.060
How many bosses who are tyrants should work as workers to feel injustice in their own flesh?

01:20:56.450 --> 01:20:59.570
Attentive modality must overcome rudeness and the stimulus to helplessness.

01:21:00.030 --> 01:21:04.870
Only then will we get hard-working employees, competent bosses and powerful companies.

01:21:05.070 --> 01:21:06.530
And you said you had gone crazy.

01:21:07.360 --> 01:21:11.570
And that recent experience I already told you about has shown me that everything is complemented.

01:21:11.710 --> 01:21:14.990
And that it is the mission of those who command to make the newspaper live a party,

01:21:15.110 --> 01:21:17.760
but an honorable and hard-working party.

01:21:17.820 --> 01:21:21.050
They survived, cold-blooded!

01:21:21.050 --> 01:21:21.530
Bravo!

01:21:22.760 --> 01:21:23.360
Very good!

01:21:23.740 --> 01:21:23.980
Very good!

01:21:25.330 --> 01:21:26.110
One moment.

01:21:27.200 --> 01:21:28.540
An important piece of news is missing.

01:21:28.540 --> 01:21:29.780
I've given you half of it.

01:21:30.420 --> 01:21:30.820
Who?

01:21:31.280 --> 01:21:33.780
A group of people who will make you pay more than I do.

01:21:33.820 --> 01:21:34.980
A financial group?

01:21:34.980 --> 01:21:35.920
The State of Michigan.

01:21:36.000 --> 01:21:36.380
Payment?

01:21:36.560 --> 01:21:38.260
We need to know who they are.

01:21:38.280 --> 01:21:39.040
Let them come here.

01:21:39.200 --> 01:21:40.640
No, we'll go to him.

01:21:40.760 --> 01:21:42.340
I'll wait for you tomorrow at 9 o'clock.

01:21:42.420 --> 01:21:42.840
Good afternoon.

01:21:43.080 --> 01:21:43.460
Good afternoon.

01:21:44.220 --> 01:21:45.880
Well, it seems to me that tomorrow...

01:21:48.500 --> 01:21:48.900
No.

01:21:52.740 --> 01:21:54.240
You come with me.

01:22:01.820 --> 01:22:03.760
Ladies and gentlemen, our new stationers!

01:22:04.100 --> 01:22:10.030
San Miguel Angel Gorducci, our friend!

01:22:10.410 --> 01:22:16.360
Learn everything!

01:22:19.780 --> 01:22:22.240
The workers, the bosses,

01:22:22.760 --> 01:22:26.100
we must not hide in cones

01:22:26.100 --> 01:22:28.990
and we have to be companions.

01:22:30.160 --> 01:22:32.580
Sincere friends and all the same

01:22:33.150 --> 01:22:35.670
With the help of each other

01:22:35.670 --> 01:22:39.990
We will have the happiness of all of us

01:22:39.990 --> 01:22:43.600
In the fight for new conquests

01:22:43.600 --> 01:22:46.320
Let's march united and always optimistic

01:22:46.320 --> 01:22:50.030
And we must live always like this

01:22:50.030 --> 01:22:53.060
Me helping you, you helping me

01:22:53.060 --> 01:22:56.960
And we must live always like this

01:22:56.960 --> 01:22:59.780
Me helping you, you helping me

01:23:00.000 --> 01:23:13.830
The bosses, the workers must be in the whole world, those who take to all sides happy fraternity songs.

01:23:13.830 --> 01:23:21.140
With the help of each other, we will have the happiness of all of us.

01:23:21.240 --> 01:23:23.760
In the struggle of new...

01:23:23.850 --> 01:23:25.500
You too!

01:23:25.860 --> 01:23:29.460
And we will take...

01:23:30.700 --> 01:23:31.280
How dare you?
